    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · play automation in progress</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You drop low, spin, and let out a belch that smells like a grave. Your allies know what is coming and hit the ground.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Main Action</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>Fortitude</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Self; each willing ally within 5 squares; then each non-prone creature within 5 squares other than you.</dd></div><div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>Immediate.</dd></div><div><dt>Equipment / acquisition</dt><dd>None.</dd></div><div><dt>Limits</dt><dd>Once on your turn.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Signature</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><dl class=\"hol-reference-outcomes\"><dt>Weak</dt><dd>1;</dd><dt>Standard</dt><dd>2;</dd><dt>Strong</dt><dd>4.</dd></dl></div><h3>Additional rulings</h3><p><strong>Tags:</strong> Skill / Attack / Control</p><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/295e858c1b6fee044a0261bf9f437636efeff2bf/design/cards/signature-odd-unlikely-assistant.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/signature-odd-unlikely-assistant.md</a> at <code>295e858c1b6fee044a0261bf9f437636efeff2bf</code>.</p></section>",
